invariant: INV-16
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh webpki_ticket_host
reason: the configuration hash of a host object ends on sha256.c whatever
  the session's ch_cfg.cpu states (docs/decisions.md 132). The
  webpki_ticket_host harness asserts that a ticket check under
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA256 ends its hash on the instructions.

--- old
#ifdef CH_CPU_RUNTIME
    sha256_final_cpu(cpu, s, out);
#else
--- new
#ifdef CH_CPU_RUNTIME
    (void)cpu;
    sha256_final(s, out);
#else
